  "html": "<section class=\"ni-hero\"><div class=\"ni-hero-copy\"><p class=\"ni-label\">MOHD MURTADHA MOHAMAD</p><p class=\"ni-affiliation\">Associate Professor<br>Faculty of Computing · Universiti Teknologi Malaysia</p><h1>Networked<br><em>intelligence.</em></h1><p class=\"ni-lede\">Building intelligent systems for environments where communication is difficult.</p><div class=\"ni-actions\"><a class=\"ni-button\" href=\"#research\">Explore research <span>&#x2197;</span></a><a href=\"#publications\">Selected work ↓</a></div><p class=\"ni-keywords\">WIRELESS SENSING / NETWORK RESILIENCE<br>APPLIED AI / AUTONOMOUS SYSTEMS</p></div><figure class=\"ni-portrait\"><span class=\"media-review-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Mohd Murtadha Mohamad at his desk in the Faculty of Computing\"><small>Media pending review</small><span>Mohd Murtadha Mohamad at his desk in the Faculty of Computing</span></span><figcaption><span>RESEARCH / PEOPLE / POSSIBILITIES</span><span>01 — UTM</span></figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"ni-metrics\" aria-label=\"Academic record\"><div><strong>81</strong><span>Scopus-indexed documents</span></div><div><strong>9</strong><span>Current doctoral researchers</span></div><div><strong>6</strong><span>Research themes</span></div><div><strong>2000</strong><span>The beginning at UTM</span></div><p>Academic record from the September 2026 source content. <a href=\"/cv/\">Explore the full CV &#x2197;</a></p></section><section class=\"ni-scroll21\" aria-labelledby=\"ni-scroll21-title\" style=\"padding:clamp(82px,10vw,148px) clamp(20px,5vw,72px);background:#171416;color:#fff;overflow:hidden\">\n<div style=\"max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto\">\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,380px),1fr));gap:32px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:clamp(42px,7vw,82px)\">\n<div><p class=\"ni-label\" style=\"margin:0 0 20px;color:#c6a15b\">NETWORKED INTELLIGENCE / SCROLL STUDY 21</p><h2 id=\"ni-scroll21-title\" style=\"margin:0;color:#fff;font-size:clamp(48px,7vw,104px);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.055em\">Ideas connect.<br><em style=\"color:#d7c9bd;font-weight:400\">Intelligence emerges.</em></h2></div>\n<p style=\"max-width:470px;margin:0;color:#bcb3b6;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65\">Six research directions move from individual inquiry towards one connected academic ecosystem.</p>\n</div>\n<div role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Connected research directions\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,220px),1fr));gap:12px\">\n<a role=\"listitem\" href=\"#featured\" style=\"min-height:220px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;background:#eee8e3;color:#171416;text-decoration:none;border-top:4px solid #c6a15b\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;opacity:.7\">01 / NETWORKS</span><strong style=\"font-size:29px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.035em\">Wireless<br>networks</strong></a>\n<a role=\"listitem\" href=\"#featured\" style=\"min-height:220px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;background:#7a1f32;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-top:4px solid #c6a15b\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;opacity:.72\">02 / SENSING</span><strong style=\"font-size:29px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.035em\">Underwater<br>sensing</strong></a>\n<a role=\"listitem\" href=\"#featured\" style=\"min-height:220px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;background:#d8c9bd;color:#171416;text-decoration:none;border-top:4px solid #7a1f32\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;opacity:.7\">03 / SECURITY</span><strong style=\"font-size:29px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.035em\">MANET<br>security</strong></a>\n<a role=\"listitem\" href=\"#featured\" style=\"min-height:220px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;background:#f7f3ef;color:#171416;text-decoration:none;border-top:4px solid #c6a15b\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;opacity:.7\">04 / POSITIONING</span><strong style=\"font-size:29px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.035em\">Indoor<br>intelligence</strong></a>\n<a role=\"listitem\" href=\"#featured\" style=\"min-height:220px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;background:#7a1f32;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-top:4px solid #c6a15b\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;opacity:.72\">05 / AUTONOMY</span><strong style=\"font-size:29px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.035em\">Autonomous<br>systems</strong></a>\n<a role=\"listitem\" href=\"#people\" style=\"min-height:220px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;background:#d8c9bd;color:#171416;text-decoration:none;border-top:4px solid #7a1f32\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;opacity:.7\">06 / PEOPLE</span><strong style=\"font-size:29px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.035em\">Research<br>community</strong></a>\n</div>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;margin:28px 0 0;color:#8f8589;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.16em\"><span>SCROLL TO CONNECT</span><span>UTM · ASCEND 2030</span></p>\n</div>\n</section><section id=\"research\" class=\"ni-section\" style=\"padding:clamp(72px,9vw,128px) 0;background:#faf8f5\">\n<div class=\"ni-wrap\">\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));gap:28px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:42px\">\n<div><div class=\"ni-kicker\">Networked intelligence</div><h2 style=\"margin:0;max-width:760px\">Networked intelligence in action.</h2></div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;max-width:620px;font-size:clamp(16px,1.5vw,20px);line-height:1.65;color:#5c5558\">A connected view of research, people, innovation and partnerships—each node contributing to a wider academic ecosystem.</p>\n</div>\n<div role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Networked intelligence themes\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,220px),1fr));gap:12px\">\n<a href=\"#about\" aria-label=\"Academic profile: Mohd Murtadha Mohamad\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;min-height:300px;padding:clamp(22px,3vw,34px);background:#7a1f32;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-top:4px solid #c6a15b\">\n<span style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:auto;padding-bottom:34px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.72\">Academic profile</span>\n<strong style=\"display:block;font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,34px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:650\">Mohd Murtadha Mohamad</strong>\n<span style=\"display:block;margin-top:14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;opacity:.82\">Wireless networks, intelligent sensing and academic leadership.</span>\n</a><a href=\"#featured\" aria-label=\"Research: Wireless networks\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;min-height:210px;padding:clamp(22px,3vw,34px);background:#f0ece7;color:#171416;text-decoration:none\">\n<span style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:auto;padding-bottom:34px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.72\">Research</span>\n<strong style=\"display:block;font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,34px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:650\">Wireless networks</strong>\n<span style=\"display:block;margin-top:14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;opacity:.82\">Resilient communication across connected environments.</span>\n</a><a href=\"#featured\" aria-label=\"Research: Underwater sensing\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;min-height:210px;padding:clamp(22px,3vw,34px);background:#171416;color:#fff;text-decoration:none\">\n<span style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:auto;padding-bottom:34px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.72\">Research</span>\n<strong style=\"display:block;font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,34px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:650\">Underwater sensing</strong>\n<span style=\"display:block;margin-top:14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;opacity:.82\">Intelligent sensing beneath the surface.</span>\n</a><a href=\"#featured\" aria-label=\"Research: MANET security\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;min-height:210px;padding:clamp(22px,3vw,34px);background:#e8e1dc;color:#171416;text-decoration:none;border-top:4px solid #c6a15b\">\n<span style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:auto;padding-bottom:34px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.72\">Research</span>\n<strong style=\"display:block;font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,34px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:650\">MANET security</strong>\n<span style=\"display:block;margin-top:14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;opacity:.82\">Trust, resilience and secure mobile networks.</span>\n</a><a href=\"#impact\" aria-label=\"Innovation: Heritage intelligence\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;min-height:210px;padding:clamp(22px,3vw,34px);background:#f3efeb;color:#171416;text-decoration:none\">\n<span style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:auto;padding-bottom:34px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.72\">Innovation</span>\n<strong style=\"display:block;font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,34px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:650\">Heritage intelligence</strong>\n<span style=\"display:block;margin-top:14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;opacity:.82\">Digital systems connecting culture, place and knowledge.</span>\n</a><a href=\"#featured\" aria-label=\"Innovation: Autonomous systems\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;min-height:210px;padding:clamp(22px,3vw,34px);background:#7a1f32;color:#fff;text-decoration:none\">\n<span style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:auto;padding-bottom:34px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.72\">Innovation</span>\n<strong style=\"display:block;font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,34px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:650\">Autonomous systems</strong>\n<span style=\"display:block;margin-top:14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;opacity:.82\">Networks that perceive, decide and adapt.</span>\n</a><a href=\"#featured\" aria-label=\"Research: Indoor positioning\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;min-height:210px;padding:clamp(22px,3vw,34px);background:#ddd4ce;color:#171416;text-decoration:none;border-top:4px solid #c6a15b\">\n<span style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:auto;padding-bottom:34px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.72\">Research</span>\n<strong style=\"display:block;font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,34px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:650\">Indoor positioning</strong>\n<span style=\"display:block;margin-top:14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;opacity:.82\">Context-aware location intelligence for complex spaces.</span>\n</a><a href=\"#people\" aria-label=\"People: Doctoral researchers\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;min-height:210px;padding:clamp(22px,3vw,34px);background:#171416;color:#fff;text-decoration:none\">\n<span style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:auto;padding-bottom:34px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.72\">People</span>\n<strong style=\"display:block;font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,34px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:650\">Doctoral researchers</strong>\n<span style=\"display:block;margin-top:14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;opacity:.82\">Advanced inquiry shaped through close supervision.</span>\n</a><a href=\"#teaching\" aria-label=\"People: Developing researchers\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;min-height:210px;padding:clamp(22px,3vw,34px);background:#eee8e3;color:#171416;text-decoration:none\">\n<span style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:auto;padding-bottom:34px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.72\">People</span>\n<strong style=\"display:block;font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,34px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:650\">Developing researchers</strong>\n<span style=\"display:block;margin-top:14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;opacity:.82\">Teaching, mentoring and building future capability.</span>\n</a><a href=\"#impact\" aria-label=\"Partnerships: Beyond campus\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;min-height:210px;padding:clamp(22px,3vw,34px);background:#7a1f32;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-top:4px solid #c6a15b\">\n<span style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:auto;padding-bottom:34px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.72\">Partnerships</span>\n<strong style=\"display:block;font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,34px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:650\">Beyond campus</strong>\n<span style=\"display:block;margin-top:14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;opacity:.82\">Research translated through meaningful collaboration.</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"featured\" class=\"ni-section \"><div class=\"ni-section-heading\"><span class=\"ni-label\">02 / RESEARCH IN CONTEXT</span><h2>Difficult places. Real questions.</h2></div><article class=\"ni-story\" id=\"story-heritage\"><div class=\"ni-story-index\">01<span>IoT / MICROCLIMATES / EXPLAINABLE AI</span></div><div><h3>Heritage intelligence.</h3><p class=\"ni-story-deck\">Sensing the invisible conditions that slowly damage historic buildings.</p><p>Microclimate monitoring and maintenance-priority prediction connect IoT sensing with applied machine learning and the heritage-building work with UTM KALAM.</p><a href=\"/research/\">Research context &#x2197;</a></div></article><article class=\"ni-story\" id=\"story-underwater\"><div class=\"ni-story-index\">02<span>UWASN / OPPORTUNISTIC ROUTING / AUV</span></div><div><h3>Networks underwater.</h3><p class=\"ni-story-deck\">Communication beyond the reach of conventional radio.</p><p>Underwater acoustic networks bring routing, energy efficiency and autonomous underwater vehicle path planning into difficult physical environments.</p><a href=\"/research/\">Research context &#x2197;</a></div></article><article class=\"ni-story\" id=\"story-manet\"><div class=\"ni-story-index\">03<span>MANET / TRUST / FEDERATED LEARNING</span></div><div><h3>Networks without infrastructure.</h3><p class=\"ni-story-deck\">Building trust into networks that keep moving.</p><p>Research on mobile ad-hoc networks connects intrusion detection, trust-aware routing and federated learning for distributed defence.</p><a href=\"/research/\">Research context &#x2197;</a></div></article><article class=\"ni-story\" id=\"story-robotics\"><div class=\"ni-story-index\">04<span>MOTION PLANNING / LOCALISATION / OPTIMISATION</span></div><div><h3>Autonomous systems.</h3><p class=\"ni-story-deck\">Finding a way through uncertain environments.</p><p>Robot navigation and path planning connect bio-inspired optimisation with localisation, extending the doctoral work on foraging ant strategies.</p><a href=\"/research/\">Research context &#x2197;</a></div></article><div class=\"ni-two\"><article id=\"story-wireless\"><h3>Wireless sensor networks</h3><p>The common thread: resilient sensing, routing and deployment with scarce energy and unstable links.</p></article><article id=\"story-positioning\"><h3>Indoor positioning</h3><p>WiFi, camera-based localisation and hybrid positioning for pedestrian navigation and emergency rescue location.</p></article></div></section><section id=\"publications\" class=\"ni-section \"><div class=\"ni-section-heading\"><span class=\"ni-label\">03 / SELECTED WORK</span><h2>Ideas, tested and shared.</h2></div><div class=\"mm ni-selected\"><div class=\"mm-pub\">\n<span class=\"mm-pub__year\">2024</span>\n<span class=\"mm-pub__title\">Advanced Intrusion Detection in MANETs: A Survey of Machine Learning and Optimization Techniques for Mitigating Black/Gray Hole Attacks</span>\n<span class=\"mm-pub__venue\">IEEE Access 12, 150046–150090</span>\n</div><div class=\"mm-pub\">\n<span class=\"mm-pub__year\">2024</span>\n<span class=\"mm-pub__title\">Enhancing MANET Security Through Federated Learning and Multiobjective Optimization: A Trust-Aware Routing Framework</span>\n<span class=\"mm-pub__venue\">IEEE Access 12, 181149–181178</span>\n</div><div class=\"mm-pub\">\n<span class=\"mm-pub__year\">2023</span>\n<span class=\"mm-pub__title\">An Overview of Machine Learning Techniques in Local Path Planning for Autonomous Underwater Vehicles</span>\n<span class=\"mm-pub__venue\">IEEE Access 11, 24894–24907</span>\n</div><div class=\"mm-pub\">\n<span class=\"mm-pub__year\">2019</span>\n<span class=\"mm-pub__title\">Toward Adaptive and Scalable OpenFlow-SDN Flow Control: A Survey</span>\n<span class=\"mm-pub__venue\">IEEE Access 7, 107346–107379</span>\n</div></div><a class=\"ni-text-link\" href=\"/publications/\">Explore the publication record &#x2197;</a></section><section id=\"journey\" class=\"ni-section \"><div class=\"ni-section-heading\"><span class=\"ni-label\">04 / ACADEMIC JOURNEY</span><h2>A career built on curiosity.</h2></div><ol class=\"ni-timeline\"><li><span>2000</span><h3>Universiti Teknologi Malaysia</h3><p>BEng (Computer); began at UTM as a tutor.</p></li><li><span>2007</span><h3>Heriot-Watt University</h3><p>PhD in Electrical Engineering, following an MSc in Embedded Systems Engineering.</p></li><li><span>2012</span><h3>Eindhoven University of Technology</h3><p>Visiting researcher.</p></li><li><span>Today</span><h3>Faculty of Computing</h3><p>Coordinator, PhD in Computer Science programme.</p></li></ol><a href=\"/cv/\">The full academic record &#x2197;</a></section><section id=\"people\" class=\"ni-section \"><div class=\"ni-section-heading\"><span class=\"ni-label\">05 / PEOPLE &amp; SUPERVISION</span><h2>Good research starts with people.</h2></div><div class=\"ni-two\"><p class=\"ni-story-deck\">Currently supervising nine doctoral candidates.</p><div><p>Research in network security, IoT intrusion detection and underwater sensing. Prospective PhD candidates can send a CV and a one-page proposal.</p><div class=\"ni-actions\"><a class=\"ni-button\" href=\"/people/\">Meet the researchers &#x2197;</a><a href=\"mailto:murtadha@utm.my?subject=PhD%20supervision%20inquiry\">Discuss a PhD &#x2197;</a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"impact\" class=\"ni-section \"><div class=\"ni-section-heading\"><span class=\"ni-label\">06 / BEYOND CAMPUS</span><h2>Research beyond papers.</h2></div><div class=\"ni-two\"><p class=\"ni-story-deck\">Advisory and applied work, grounded in real environments.</p><div><p>Industry engagement on sensing deployments, network resilience and data-driven monitoring. Explore the existing consultancy record, including project values and partners.</p><a href=\"/impact/\">Consultancy &amp; industry engagement &#x2197;</a></div></div></section><section id=\"teaching\" class=\"ni-section \"><div class=\"ni-section-heading\"><span class=\"ni-label\">07 / KNOWLEDGE IN PRACTICE</span><h2>Teaching the next questions.</h2></div><div class=\"ni-two\"><p class=\"ni-story-deck\">From fundamentals to independent research.</p><div><p>Eight undergraduate subjects across twenty-eight semesters, alongside postgraduate supervision and professional service.</p><a href=\"/teaching/\">Explore the teaching record &#x2197;</a></div></div></section><section id=\"collaboration\" class=\"ni-section \"><div class=\"ni-section-heading\"><span class=\"ni-label\">09 / GLOBAL ENGAGEMENT</span><h2>Research crosses borders.</h2></div><div class=\"ni-two\"><p class=\"ni-story-deck\">Connected through institutions, ideas and shared questions.</p><div><h3>Heriot-Watt University</h3><p>Postgraduate study in embedded systems and electrical engineering.</p><h3>Eindhoven University of Technology</h3><p>Visiting research appointment, 2012.</p><a href=\"/biography/\">Read the biography &#x2197;</a></div></div></section><section class=\"ni-cta\"><p class=\"ni-label\">THE NEXT CONNECTION</p><h2>Let’s ask a<br><em>better question.</em></h2><a href=\"mailto:murtadha@utm.my?subject=Research%20collaboration\">Research, supervision or collaboration &#x2197;<br>murtadha@utm.my</a></section><section class=\"ni-section\"></section>"
}
